{"id":"word:hebrew:H6950","type":"word","title":"קָהַל","subtitle":"H6950 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to convoke","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to קָהַל (H6950) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 39 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"קָהַל (qâhal) means to convoke First listed occurrence: 1Chr 13 5."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"קָהַל","transliteration":"qâhal","pronunciation":"'kaw-hal'","strong":"H6950","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6950","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["וַ/יִּקָּ֨הֲל֜וּ","וַ/יַּקְהֵ֣ל","וַ/יַּקְהֵל֩","נִקְהֲלוּ֙","וַ/יִּקָּ֣הֲל֔וּ"],"morphs":[["HC/VNw3mp",8],["HC/Vhw3ms",7],["HVNp3cp",4],["HVhv2ms",3],["HR/VNc",2],["HC/VNw3ms",2],["HC/VNw3fs",2],["HVhj3ms",1],["HVhi3ms",1],["HVhv2mp",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"to convoke","usage":"assemble (selves) (together), gather (selves) (together).","full":"H6950. qahal [ קָהַל ] verb denominative (Gerber 107f. ) assemble as a קָהָל ; — Niph`al Perfect 3masculine plural נִקְהֲלוּ Est 9:2-3 t.; Imperfect 3masculine singular וַיִּקָּהֵל Exod 32:1 ; Jer 26:9 ; 3 masculine plural וַיִּקָּֽהֲלוּ 2Sam 20:14 Qr (Kt ויקלהו , compare HPS), etc.; Infinitive construct הִקָּהֵל Num 17:7 ; Est 8:11 ; Participle plural נִקְהָלִים Ezek 38:7 ; &#8212; assemble as a קָהָל : 1. a. for conflict or war 2Sam 20:14 (Qr; see above), Est 8:11 ; 9:2 , 15 , 16 , 18 ; with עַל person Ezek 38:7 , accusative of location Josh 22:12 ; Judg 20:1 . b. rebellion, with עַל person Num 16:3 ; 17:7 ; 20:2 (P), possibly also Exod 32:1 (J; most, unto Aaron). 2 for religious purposes: to erect tent of meeting, accusative of location Josh 18:1 (P); hear word of ׳י , with אֶל location Lev 8:4 (P), ב location + אֶל person Jer 26:9 ; for festival, אֶל person 1Kin 8:2 2Chr 5:3 ; לְ local 20:26 . Hiph`il Perfect 2masculine singular הִקְהַלְתָּ Ezek 38:13 , וְהִקְהַלְתָּ֫ Num 8:9 ; 3 masculine plural הִקְהִילוּ 1:18 ; Imperfect 3masculine singular יַקְהִיל Job 11:10 ; יַקְהֵל אָז 1Kin 8:1 = יַקְהֵיל 2Chr 5:2 ; וַיַּקְהֵל Exod 35:1 + ( Qal Imperfect in i according to Ba NB p. 147 ); plural וַיַּקְהִלוּ Num 20:10 ; Imperative masculine singular הַקְהֵל Lev 8:3 +, etc.; Infinitive construct הַקְהִיל Num 10:7 ; &#8212; summon an assembly: 1. a. for judgment Job 11:10 . b. for war 1Kin 12:21 2Chr 11:1 ; Ezek 38:13 . 2 for religious purposes: with accusative אֶתהַֿקָּהָל Num 10:7 , + אֶל location 20:10 , with accusative (כָּלֿ)הָעֵדָה Exod 35:1 ; Num 1:18 ; 8:9 ; 20:8 (P), + אל location Lev 8:3 ; Num 16:19 (P); with accusative הָעָם Deut 4:10 ; 31:12 ; כָּליֿשׂראל 1Chr 13:5 ; 15:3 ; elders of tribes Deut 31:28 , of Israel 1Kin 8:1 2Chr 5:2 ; princes of Israel 1Chr 28:1 .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 13 5","keyReferences":["1Chr 13 5","1Chr 15 3","1Chr 28 1","1Kgs 8 1","1Kgs 8 2","1Kgs 12 21","2Chr 5 2","2Chr 5 3"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":39,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 13 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":13,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יַּקְהֵ֤ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhw3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 3","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יַּקְהֵ֥ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhw3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 28 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יַּקְהֵ֣ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhw3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 1","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יַקְהֵ֣ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhj3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 2","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּקָּ֨הֲל֜וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/VNw3mp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 12 21","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יַּקְהֵל֩","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhw3m